    {region:'Abdomen',symptom:'Every emission of flatulence is preceded by pinching in the abdomen.'},
    {region:'Abdomen',symptom:'Tensive and burning pain in the epigastrium and hypogastrium, followed by a drawing and tensive pain in the calves.'},
    {region:'Abdomen',symptom:'Itching of the umbilicus. Stool'},
    {region:'Abdomen',symptom:'Diarrhea without colic.'},
    {region:'Abdomen',symptom:'Constipation as if the rectum were constricted and contracted.'},
    {region:'Abdomen',symptom:'Violent hemorrhoidal pain in the anus after stool, erosive as if sore, and as if the rectum were constricted.'},
    {region:'Abdomen',symptom:'Burning at the anus when sitting, as in hemorrhoids.'},
    {region:'Abdomen',symptom:'Itching hemorrhoids.'},
    {region:'Abdomen',symptom:'Blind harmorrhoids after soft stool, as if the varices on the margin of the anus felt sore, both when sitting and walking.'},
    {region:'Abdomen',symptom:'Prolapsus recti when going to stool'},
    {region:'Urinary System',symptom:'Burning in the bladder, especially in the region of the neck of the bladder, a few minutes after urinating.'},
    {region:'Male Reproductive System',symptom:'Burning in the urethra, in the region of the caput gallinaginis, during an emission of semen.'},
    {region:'Male Reproductive System',symptom:'Early in the morning he feels a burning in the region of the vesiculae seminales.'},
    {region:'Male Reproductive System',symptom:'Nightly emissions of semen.'},
    {region:'Male Reproductive System',symptom:'Violent continuous erections, early in the morning when in bed, without any sexual desire.'},
    {region:'Male Reproductive System',symptom:'Want of sexual desire, aversion to an embrace.'},
    {region:'Male Reproductive System',symptom:'The penis remains in a relaxed condition, in spite of all sexual excitement.'},
    {region:'Male Reproductive System',symptom:'The prepuce retreats entirely behind the glans.'},
    {region:'Male Reproductive System',symptom:'Swelling of the epididymis, with simple pain when feeling it or during motion.'},
    {region:'Male Reproductive System',symptom:'Itching smarting of the inner surface of the prepuce.'},
    {region:'Female Reproductive System',symptom:'Menses had ceased a few days before, returned next day after imposing the magnetic surface and continued ten days.'},
    {region:'Respiratory System',symptom:'Frequent fits of nightly cough which does not wake him.'},
    {region:'Respiratory System',symptom:'Convulsive cough.'},
    {region:'Respiratory System',symptom:'Mucus in the trachea which is easily hawked up, evening and morning.'},
    {region:'Respiratory System',symptom:'Violent fit of cough, with profuse expectoration of blood.'},
    {region:'Respiratory System',symptom:'Asthma after midnight when waking and reflecting, occasioned by mucus in the chest, diminished by coughing.'},
    {region:'Respiratory System',symptom:'Spasmodic cough, with shocks in the chest and anxious breathing, and visible oppression of the chest.'},
    {region:'Respiratory System',symptom:'Violent oppression of the chest, tearing in the stomach and bowels, and beating in the shoulders. Neck and Back'},
    {region:'Respiratory System',symptom:'Painful stiffness of the cervical vertebra in the morning, during motion.'},
    {region:'Respiratory System',symptom:'Crackling in the cervical vertebra in the morning during motion.'},
    {region:'Respiratory System',symptom:'Pain in the omohyoid muscle, as if it would be attached with cramp.'},
    {region:'Respiratory System',symptom:'Pain in the back when standing or sitting quiet.'},
    {region:'Respiratory System',symptom:'Burning in the dorsal spine.'},
    {region:'Respiratory System',symptom:'Twitching of the muscles of the back and sensation as if something were alive in them.'},
    {region:'Respiratory System',symptom:'Pain in sacro-lumbar articulation, in the morning when in bed lying on the side, and in daytime when stooping a long time.'},
    {region:'Respiratory System',symptom:'Shock or jerk in the small of the back, almost arresting the breathing.'},
    {region:'Extremities',symptom:'Tearing jerkings in the muscles of the arm when staying in a cold place.'},
    {region:'Extremities',symptom:'Shocks in the top of the shoulder which caused the arms to recede from the body with a jerk.'},
    {region:'Extremities',symptom:'Shocks in the arm joints and head, as if those parts were beaten with a light and small hammer.'},
    {region:'Extremities',symptom:'Prickings in the arms.'},
    {region:'Extremities',symptom:'Beating and throbbing in all the joints of the arms and fingers.'},
    {region:'Extremities',symptom:'Deep-seated pain in the arm, extending as far as the elbow, the arm going to sleep and trembling spasmodically.'},
    {region:'Extremities',symptom:'Drawing from the head down to the tip of the fingers.'},
    {region:'Extremities',symptom:'The hands are icy cold the whole day, for several days, from touching the centre of the bar.'},
    {region:'Extremities',symptom:'Pain in the wrist joint, as if a tendon had become strained, or as if an electric shock were passing through the parts.'},
    {region:'Extremities',symptom:'Attacks of cramp in the calves and toes after walking.'},
    {region:'Extremities',symptom:'Drawing from the hips to the feet, leaving a burning along that tract.'},
    {region:'Extremities',symptom:'Violent shocks of the right lower limb, occasioned by a burning emanation from the chin and neck through the right side.'},
    {region:'Extremities',symptom:'Fiery burning in the upper and lower limbs; when the right limb touched the left one, if seemed as if the latter were set on the fire by the former.'},
    {region:'Extremities',symptom:'Pain in the upper part of the tarsal joints, as if the shoe had pinched him, and as if a corn were there.'},
    {region:'Sleep',symptom:'Coma vigil early in the morning for several hours; after sunrise, sopor or deep sleep set in full of heavy, passionate dreams, for instance, vexing dreams; the sopor terminates in a headache as if the brain were sore all over, disappearing after rising.'},
    {region:'Sleep',symptom:'Lascivious dreams, even during the siesta, with discharge of the prostatic fluid.'},
    {region:'Skin',symptom:'The recent wound commences to bleed again.'},
    {region:'Skin',symptom:'The wound, which is almost healed, commences to pain again like a recent wound.'},
    {region:'Skin',symptom:'Boils break out on various parts of the body, passing off soon.'},
    {region:'Skin',symptom:'Corrosive pain in various parts, for example, below the ankle.'}
